*.root

# -------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CERN plot data policy
# -------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ROOT canvas dumps (figures/**/macro_*.C, written by TCanvas::SaveSource)
# and the figure PDFs (*.pdf) embed CERN plot data, so they must NOT appear on
# the PUBLIC GitHub mirror. They ARE kept here on the canonical GitLab repo.
#
# They are deliberately NOT ignored below: ignoring them here would stop GitLab
# from tracking them. Instead, ./publish-github.sh strips macro_*.C and *.pdf
# from the ENTIRE history and force-pushes a scrubbed mirror to GitHub (that
# mirror carries its own .gitignore that DOES exclude them). See that script.
# -------------------------------------------------------------------------

# CERN plot data - kept on GitLab only, never on this public mirror.
macro_*.C
*.pdf
